refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.parameters;



  &curl.mh.description;

   timeout



     Time, in seconds, to wait for a response from the active cURL multi handle connections.

&reftitle.errors;

 Throws a ValueError if timeout
 is less than 0 or greater than 2147483.647.

&reftitle.changelog;





    &Version;
    &Description;





    8.4.0

     Now throws a ValueError if timeout
     is less than 0 or greater than 2147483.647.
     Previously, an E_WARNING was emitted and
     -1 was returned.




    8.3.12

     An E_WARNING is now emitted and -1
     is returned if timeout is less than
     0 or greater than 2147483.647.


   &curl.changelog.multi-handle-param;
